    {
        "id": "en:word:structure-as-long-as",
        "label": "as long as",
        "fields": {
            "part_of_speech": "conjunction",
            "pronunciation": ["/əz lɒŋ əz/"],
            "audio": "audio/a30f6943aa715e702b0b85f28f643a99678c568e82e131c1db63578836217b36.wav",
            "reference_images": [
                "images/67f32f3a17337d45a75b0c00b87e9c2af867ff28f2da5a5ec2bf3598827b88fd.jpg"
            ],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "As long as can state a condition. Example: The plant will stay healthy as long as you water it regularly. Regular watering is the condition in this example; the phrase can also express duration in other contexts.",
                "de": "As long as kann eine Bedingung ausdrücken. „The plant will stay healthy as long as you water it regularly.“ = Die Pflanze bleibt gesund, solange du sie regelmäßig gießt. Hier ist das Gießen die Bedingung; in anderen Zusammenhängen kann die Wendung auch eine Dauer ausdrücken.",
                "id": "As long as dapat menyatakan syarat. “The plant will stay healthy as long as you water it regularly.” = Tanaman itu akan tetap sehat selama kamu menyiramnya secara teratur. Penyiraman teratur adalah syarat dalam contoh ini; dalam konteks lain frasa ini juga dapat menyatakan durasi.",
                "ja": "as long asは条件を表せます。「The plant will stay healthy as long as you water it regularly.」＝定期的に水をやる限り、その植物は健康な状態を保ちます。この例では水やりが条件です。別の文脈では期間も表せます。"
            }
        },
